</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God as the Father is the source,</l><l>And God the Son doth Him express;</l><l>God as the Spirit enters us,</l><l>That God as all we may possess.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Father, who is veiled in light,</l><l>The Son to man hath fully shown;</l><l>The Spirit then transmitteth Him</l><l>That He may inwardly be known.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The Son within the Father is,</l><l>And now the Spirit is the Son.</l><l>The Spirit, Son, and Father God</l><l>Are now in us and with us one.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>God as the Father in the Son</l><l>Has been embodied and expressed,</l><l>And God the Spirit is the Son’s</l><l>Reality to be possessed.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>May God the Father’s love to us</l><l>In God the Son as grace be known,</l><l>Thru God the Spirit’s fellowship,</l><l>That God our portion we may own.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
